{"case_id":"C007","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["API protocol","configuration","state","input semantics"],"confidence":99,"affected_functions":["wuffs_jpeg__decoder__set_quirk","wuffs_jpeg__decoder__get_quirk","wuffs_jpeg__decoder__decode_image_config","wuffs_jpeg__decoder__do_decode_image_config","wuffs_jpeg__decoder__workbuf_len"],"reason":"H0 initializes the JPEG decoder and immediately passes it to fuzz_image_decoder without calling set_quirk or get_quirk. It therefore never enables QUIRK_REJECT_PROGRESSIVE_JPEGS, never exercises its enabled/disabled state transitions, and cannot reach the new progressive-SOF rejection behavior. H0 also always allocates workbuf_len(dec).max_incl, so it misses the documented zero-minimum work-buffer protocol associated with combining rejection of progressive JPEGs and lower-quality decoding.","evidence":["S1 adds decoder.reject_progressive_jpegs and exposes it through decoder.set_quirk and decoder.get_quirk using QUIRK_REJECT_PROGRESSIVE_JPEGS.","S1's do_decode_image_config returns \"#rejected progressive JPEG\" when marker == 0xC2 and reject_progressive_jpegs is true.","H0 calls wuffs_jpeg__decoder__initialize and then fuzz_image_decoder; neither shown function calls wuffs_base__image_decoder__set_quirk, wuffs_jpeg__decoder__set_quirk, or get_quirk.","fuzz_image_decoder unconditionally selects wuffs_base__image_decoder__workbuf_len(dec).max_incl and allocates that amount, leaving min_incl and a zero-length work buffer untested.","The S1 declaration explicitly documents the interaction between QUIRK_REJECT_PROGRESSIVE_JPEGS, base.QUIRK_QUALITY lower-quality mode, progressive inputs, and workbuf_len().min_incl."],"recommended_action":"Extend H0's hash-driven configuration to call set_quirk with QUIRK_REJECT_PROGRESSIVE_JPEGS using both zero and non-zero values, optionally verify get_quirk, and combine this with lower-quality base.QUIRK_QUALITY. Fuzz both progressive (0xC2 SOF) and sequential JPEG inputs, and exercise workbuf_len().min_incl—including a valid zero-length work buffer—in addition to max_incl."}
